Proof of Pollaczek-Khinchin Formula
\layout Itemize

Proof of the Pollaczek-Khinchin formula.
 
\layout Itemize

In our proof we will make three assumptions
\begin_deeper 
\layout Enumerate

The queue is FIFO queue, 
\emph on 
i.e.
 
\emph default 
customers are served in the order they arrive.
 This assumption may be relaxed but it will simplify our proof.
\layout Enumerate

The arrival times are statistically independent of the service times.
 
\layout Enumerate

The arrival time distribution has a variance which is finite.
\end_deeper 
\layout Itemize

To formulate the proof we introduce a concept known as the mean residual
 service time.
\layout ShortFoilhead

